{"title":"2012 IMO Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_IMO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find all positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> for which there exist non-negative integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/a/a2a25c2f9720d16d7ab307b6766d3539fad0a05b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1, a_2, \\ldots, a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"103\" height=\"13\" /> such that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/f/b0fa90026dcd8289f99183337e2bfd121077dd0f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{2^{a_1}} + \\frac{1}{2^{a_2}} + \\cdots + \\frac{1}{2^{a_n}} =  \\frac{1}{3^{a_1}} + \\frac{2}{3^{a_2}} + \\cdots + \\frac{n}{3^{a_n}} = 1.\\]\" width=\"403\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Evan_Chen.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Evan_Chen)\">Solution 1 (Evan Chen)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_IMO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Evan Chen)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Good luck to solving this problem. Just in case you wanted some help: \n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://web.evanchen.cc/exams/IMO-2012-notes.pdf\">https://web.evanchen.cc/exams/IMO-2012-notes.pdf</a>\n</p><p>Who doesn't like Evan Chen?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_IMO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_IMO\" title=\"2012 IMO\">2012 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_IMO_Problems\" title=\"2012 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2012 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2012 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2012 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2012 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2012 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2012 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>Last Problem</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\"> All IMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time